  <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opapi</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_kernel</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opgraph</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/2916/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-03-19 14:55:38] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-03-19T14:47:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T14:55:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165738056,"discussion_id":"17b75a7dc7b424c1a776dbdbe9a254b5b8d5b778","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了EmbeddingDenseGradV2算子在进行核间梯度累加时，因同步缺失可能导致的计算正确性问题。具体而言，在检查不同核间是否存在相同索引的过程中，向量寄存器的比较操作与后续的标量统计操作之间缺少必要的硬件同步屏障，可能导致统计结果不准确，进而影响跨核梯度累加的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`CheckHasSameIndices`函数中，于将向量比较结果转换为标量并进行统计之前，显式插入了针对`HardEvent::V_S`（向量到标量）硬件事件的同步操作。通过获取、设置并等待该事件，确保了向量比较操作的结果在标量统计开始前已完全就绪，从而保证了跨核索引一致性检查逻辑的可靠性。此修改范围极小，仅涉及底层内核代码的同步优化，不改变任何对外接口。","created_at":"2026-03-19T14:54:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T14:54:10+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165742428,"discussion_id":"545e61b6d7a3bb70788268cc16cf5f9b89df8dae","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-03-19T15:15:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T15:15:06+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","object_id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165755669,"discussion_id":"f827a6a53a718983368459245318536b799a8c7a","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-03-19T16:13:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T16:13:49+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c8bee4b985165b4b0686","login":"fanqirui","object_id":"6822c8bee4b985165b4b0686","name":"范其瑞","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ce/fc0c4ea3a1475e7c17f62a0f56f5cc495303247ae65117dc587acd502be1f96c.png?time=1753758215470","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/fanqirui"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165755725,"discussion_id":"1748dce85d315ea5b30d40d6d1ffcdd939fb23e5","body":"### Review Guide\n\n This pull-request **passes review**.\n Committers who wrote a comment of `/approve` are: [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317).\nReviewers who wrote a comment of `/lgtm` are: [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*fanqirui*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui).\n","created_at":"2026-03-19T16:14:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T16:14:00+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login